  "definition": "A “beneficial interest in which is not represented by transferable shares”, as used in RSA 77:3, I(b), means an interest in an organization",
  "effectiveDate": "2022-08-12",
  "historyNote": "#4557, eff 12-28-88; ss by #5947, eff 12-29-94; ss by #6321, eff 8-22-96; ss by #8137, eff 8-10-04; ss by #9658, eff 2-24-10; ss by #9843, eff 12-23-10 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 900); ss by #10211, eff 10-24-12; renumbered by #10795 (from Rev 901.02); ss by #13433, eff 8-12-22",
